        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[20260830_笔记库组织结构]]></title>
            <link>https://dzl1943.github.io/blog/20260830_笔记库组织结构</link>
            <guid>https://dzl1943.github.io/blog/20260830_笔记库组织结构</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[私人]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>私人</p>
<ul>
<li class="">Memos 备忘录</li>
<li class="">Journals 日记</li>
<li class="">Thoughts 思想认知</li>
</ul>
<p>笔记（类似卢曼的卡片笔记法）</p>
<ul>
<li class="">Jottings 闪念笔记</li>
<li class="">Pages 永久笔记</li>
<li class="">References 文献笔记</li>
</ul>
<p>辅助</p>
<ul>
<li class="">Inbox</li>
<li class="">Archives</li>
<li class="">Attachments</li>
<li class="">Clippings</li>
<li class="">Templates</li>
<li class="">Scripts</li>
<li class="">Misc</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>[!NOTE]+ Pages 是什么、不是什么，与其他类型的区别、联系是什么</p>
<p>Pages 与 References 相对应。在整个知识网络中，前者更加内部、个人、主观，相当于 Thoughts 的扩充，以“永久笔记”为主；后者则更加外部、公共、客观，相当于文献笔记。</p>
<ul>
<li class="">moc：可能是永久也可能是文献</li>
<li class="">卡片：主要属于文献笔记</li>
<li class="">闪念：和卡片笔记相比更加“草稿”，甚至连标题都没有</li>
<li class="">博客：和闪念相比更加系统、完善</li>
<li class="">永久笔记：节点永久</li>
<li class="">文献笔记：内容稳定</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Pages 需搭配双链和属性使用</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p>属性参考：</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">title</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic"># 可省略</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">author</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic"># 可省略</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">date</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">last</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">url</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic"># published_url? source_url? refer_url?</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">status</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">type</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">categories</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">tags</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic"># 支持嵌套但不支持链接</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule" style="color:#00a4db">aliases</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></content:encoded>
